        "subDiscription": "We are here to make your skin feel",
        "phoneProductDiscription": "This is skincare at its finest - a curated set offering protective care for every stage of life. Featuring two essential formulas, it repairs and nurtures both your face and under-eye skin from within, delivering a holistic boost of pro-healing and pro-resilience to keep your skin healthy, strong and ready for anything each day!",
